WEBVTT

00:00:02.830 --> 00:00:06.340
Who is that? Who? Who?

00:00:06.670 --> 00:00:12.610
That is the devil! Devilman! Devilman!

00:00:12.610 --> 00:00:14.410
DEVILMAN

00:00:14.410 --> 00:00:21.880
This man took on the name "traitor"
He threw away everything to fight

00:00:22.050 --> 00:00:25.660
His Devil Arrow is a supersonic wave
His Devil Ears can hear anything

00:00:25.790 --> 00:00:29.330
His Devil Wing lets him fly through the air
His Devil Beam is a ray of heat

00:00:29.530 --> 00:00:36.270
With the power of a devil inside him

00:00:36.570 --> 00:00:45.180
He's a hero who fights for justice
Devilman Devilman

00:00:48.940 --> 00:00:56.290
This man first learned of human love
That kindness awakened him

00:00:56.590 --> 00:01:00.530
His Devil Chop has punching power
His Devil Kick has destructive power

00:01:00.660 --> 00:01:04.190
His Devil Eye has X-ray power
His Devil Cutter can break through rocks

00:01:04.460 --> 00:01:11.340
With the power of a devil inside him

00:01:11.600 --> 00:01:20.210
He's a hero who fights for justice
Devilman Devilman

00:01:34.290 --> 00:01:37.100
Arise, Demon God!

00:01:44.700 --> 00:01:47.400
I have long awaited this opportunity.

00:01:47.400 --> 00:01:52.400
All demons sent before were
defeated by the detestable Devilman.

00:01:53.740 --> 00:01:54.810
Go forth , God!

00:01:56.040 --> 00:01:58.050
For the pride of the Demon Tribe!

00:01:58.050 --> 00:02:02.520
You must kill Devilman
and conquer the world!

00:02:03.920 --> 00:02:07.820
I understand, Lord Xenon.
I have an excellent plan.

00:02:07.820 --> 00:02:08.660
I shall not fail!

00:02:10.290 --> 00:02:12.200
On my honor!

00:02:12.930 --> 00:02:14.530
Well then, I shall proceed.

00:02:16.800 --> 00:02:21.870
DEMON GOD
THE MIRACLES OF GOD

00:02:29.710 --> 00:02:30.880
Akira!

00:02:31.780 --> 00:02:33.750
Akira, it's terrible!

00:02:33.750 --> 00:02:37.250
Shut up!
It was right at the best part!

00:02:38.020 --> 00:02:40.230
Did you have another
fight with Miyo?

00:02:40.760 --> 00:02:43.240
It's not that!

00:02:43.960 --> 00:02:46.260
Hurry and look at the IV!

00:02:46.260 --> 00:02:48.300
What the hell happened?

00:02:48.300 --> 00:02:50.130
Just hurry Up!

00:02:50.130 --> 00:02:53.300
Okay, all right!
Hey, don't pull so hard!

00:02:53.300 --> 00:02:55.250
What in the world is going on?

00:02:56.240 --> 00:02:58.710
I just can’t make any sense of it.

00:02:58.710 --> 00:03:00.410
Akira!

00:03:00.410 --> 00:03:03.650
It's a disaster! The Tower of Babel
just appeared at Haneda Airport!

00:03:04.080 --> 00:03:05.320
What the hell?!

00:03:34.180 --> 00:03:35.950
What's that?

00:04:52.190 --> 00:04:53.790
What's wrong, Miyo?

00:04:56.990 --> 00:04:58.330
It's a shark! A shark!

00:04:58.330 --> 00:04:59.960
How can there be a shark here?

00:05:01.000 --> 00:05:03.570
Woah, here it comes!

00:05:11.910 --> 00:05:13.720
Not again!

00:05:34.030 --> 00:05:37.810
That was a real shark.
It wasn't a demon in disguise.

00:05:42.100 --> 00:05:45.770
There's only one person who
could do such things...

00:05:45.770 --> 00:05:47.120
Demon God!

00:05:50.450 --> 00:05:52.190
Well done, Devilman!

00:05:52.980 --> 00:05:56.930
Xenon must be desperate if he's
sent out the Captain of the Guard.

00:05:58.290 --> 00:05:59.850
Say what you wish.

00:05:59.850 --> 00:06:03.360
As you know, I'm your
superior in the Demon World.

00:06:03.360 --> 00:06:04.930
And what of it?

00:06:04.930 --> 00:06:09.560
In other words, I know your
weakness better than anyone.

00:06:09.560 --> 00:06:10.840
Weakness?

00:06:12.030 --> 00:06:13.910
I'm not sure I have one.

00:06:14.170 --> 00:06:16.510
- You're finished!
- What?

00:06:17.070 --> 00:06:19.810
How about I reveal your
identity to this girl?

00:06:19.810 --> 00:06:20.980
What did you say?!

00:06:21.540 --> 00:06:22.490
Damn...

00:06:23.610 --> 00:06:25.150
What's your answer?

00:06:25.150 --> 00:06:27.790
Do it, and I swear I'll...

00:06:28.320 --> 00:06:32.770
If you make a promise with me,
I won't say a thing.

00:06:33.690 --> 00:06:34.790
A promise?

00:06:35.260 --> 00:06:38.290
Promise you will not interfere
with me in any way.

00:06:40.300 --> 00:06:44.030
As long as you keep your
promise, I shall keep mine.

00:06:44.030 --> 00:06:48.310
Not that you would have the
courage to break your promise.

00:06:50.670 --> 00:06:53.020
Damn you, Demon God!

00:07:09.920 --> 00:07:11.270
Miki.

00:07:14.260 --> 00:07:15.800
There, all done!

00:07:21.740 --> 00:07:24.510
- What?
- No, it's nothing...

00:07:28.980 --> 00:07:30.550
You're acting weird, Akira.

00:07:34.720 --> 00:07:38.290
Here in this world, I learned
about love for the first time.

00:07:38.290 --> 00:07:41.560
That kindness has awakened my heart

00:07:41.560 --> 00:07:45.790
That's why I betrayed the Demon
Tribe and made them my enemy.

00:07:45.790 --> 00:07:49.570
The human world is the only
place I can call home.

00:07:51.970 --> 00:07:54.950
I must not let the humans
know my true identity.

00:07:55.500 --> 00:07:59.210
If I am to stay in
the human world with Miki...

00:08:02.640 --> 00:08:06.060
No matter what happens, I must
not interfere with Demon God.

00:08:16.890 --> 00:08:18.790
Woah, it's happening again!

00:08:18.790 --> 00:08:21.660
I can't quite make sense
of what's going on, but...

00:08:21.660 --> 00:08:25.000
It seems a dinosaur has appeared
out of nowhere in Hibiya Park!

00:08:25.000 --> 00:08:27.880
They are believed to have been extinct
for thousands of years!

00:09:45.750 --> 00:09:46.980
Dammit!

00:09:46.980 --> 00:09:49.480
Demon God is doing as he pleases!

00:09:53.150 --> 00:09:56.620
But no matter what,
I can't get in God's way!

00:10:01.800 --> 00:10:03.370
Let there be water!

00:10:12.710 --> 00:10:14.450
Let there be fire!

00:10:28.020 --> 00:10:30.560
He has the power to change
his thoughts into reality!

00:10:30.560 --> 00:10:32.990
God is truly invincible!

00:10:32.990 --> 00:10:38.210
At last, the human world will fall
into the hands of the Demon Tribe!

00:10:41.140 --> 00:10:44.380
If this goes on, this world
will fall into their hands.

00:10:44.710 --> 00:10:46.710
But if I try to fight...

00:10:51.550 --> 00:10:54.760
Dammit!
What should I do?

00:11:07.760 --> 00:11:09.760
Let there be lightning!

00:11:22.080 --> 00:11:23.650
The plane's falling!

00:11:28.180 --> 00:11:31.290
- Fire!
-Emergency!

00:11:38.830 --> 00:11:40.900
Split the earth asunder!

00:11:59.550 --> 00:12:01.510
It's hopeless!
We can't get any closer!

00:12:01.520 --> 00:12:03.620
But Tare and Miyo are there!

00:12:04.550 --> 00:12:07.250
Tare! Miyo!

00:12:07.250 --> 00:12:08.730
Sis!

00:12:09.320 --> 00:12:11.130
We can't get out!

00:12:11.830 --> 00:12:14.310
Sis, save us!

00:12:14.960 --> 00:12:16.870
Akira, we have to do something!

00:12:17.330 --> 00:12:18.800
Sis!

00:12:18.800 --> 00:12:20.530
They'll die if we don't!

00:12:20.530 --> 00:12:23.240
Dammit, I can't stand it any longer.

00:12:24.970 --> 00:12:27.750
I swear I'll save them.
Miki, wait for me!

00:12:29.680 --> 00:12:30.350
Akira...

00:12:34.250 --> 00:12:37.660
I don't care what happens.
I can't stand by and do nothing.

00:12:40.960 --> 00:12:44.370
DEVIL!

00:12:51.170 --> 00:12:52.840
Devil Wing!

00:13:02.610 --> 00:13:04.110
Devilman!

00:13:04.450 --> 00:13:06.050
Demon God?

00:13:06.050 --> 00:13:08.050
You broke our promise, Devilman!

00:13:08.520 --> 00:13:11.050
I can't allow you to keep
doing whatever you want!

00:13:11.990 --> 00:13:16.890
What? You know the consequence
for breaking our promise!

00:13:16.890 --> 00:13:18.370
I'm prepared for it.

00:13:20.760 --> 00:13:25.440
Imbecile! The time has come
for you to pay.

00:13:30.200 --> 00:13:33.190
- They're both safe.
- Akira!

00:13:35.910 --> 00:13:37.980
Hurry, they need medical attention!

00:13:37.980 --> 00:13:39.580
Thank you, Akira.

00:13:42.350 --> 00:13:44.890
Akira, thank you!

00:13:48.220 --> 00:13:49.930
A monster!

00:13:51.630 --> 00:13:56.130
I admit that I am a monster,
but to some I am God.

00:13:56.130 --> 00:13:57.840
Let there be rain!

00:14:01.340 --> 00:14:02.940
Let there be lightning!

00:14:08.140 --> 00:14:09.940
Do you understand, Miki Makimura?

00:14:09.940 --> 00:14:11.950
I am God almighty.

00:14:11.950 --> 00:14:15.520
I can make any miracle occur
just by praying for it.

00:14:15.520 --> 00:14:17.650
Then, the Tower of Babel
and the Sphinx...

00:14:17.650 --> 00:14:20.790
That is correct.
But, do not be surprised yet!

00:14:21.490 --> 00:14:25.200
Akira Fudo!
He is a monster like myself!

00:14:27.090 --> 00:14:29.230
He is Devilman!

00:14:36.800 --> 00:14:41.410
DEVIL!

00:14:47.050 --> 00:14:50.180
You have finally transformed
in front of her, Devilman!

00:14:50.180 --> 00:14:53.630
This is Akira Fudo's true form!
Understand now?

00:14:54.490 --> 00:14:57.160
You finally see my true form, Miki.

00:14:57.930 --> 00:14:59.630
- It's a lie!
- What?

00:14:59.630 --> 00:15:03.400
This is your doing!
Another of your "miracles"!

00:15:03.400 --> 00:15:07.270
Fool, his transformation was
not my doing! Akira Fudo--

00:15:07.270 --> 00:15:08.300
Liar!

00:15:08.300 --> 00:15:12.180
It must be you!
Akira isn't a monster!

00:15:12.840 --> 00:15:14.540
And you aren't God!

00:15:14.540 --> 00:15:19.110
If you were, you wouldn't be
doing these things to our world!

00:15:19.110 --> 00:15:22.220
God lives here in our heads!

00:15:23.850 --> 00:15:25.790
Monster who calls himself God!

00:15:25.790 --> 00:15:28.390
Turn Akira back to normal right now!

00:15:28.390 --> 00:15:29.460
You wretch...

00:15:29.460 --> 00:15:31.460
Let divine punishment befall you!

00:15:31.460 --> 00:15:33.440
Let there be a tornado!

00:15:45.610 --> 00:15:48.310
Devil Arrow!

00:15:49.440 --> 00:15:52.750
Again? In that case, Devilman...

00:15:52.750 --> 00:15:55.250
It seems it is time for God
and Devil to fight!

00:15:55.250 --> 00:15:56.590
Just as I want it!

00:15:58.320 --> 00:16:00.230
Devil Wing!

00:16:04.090 --> 00:16:06.030
Here I come, Devilman!

00:16:06.030 --> 00:16:08.510
Let there be a cyclone!

00:16:18.310 --> 00:16:20.650
Let there be lightning!

00:16:34.590 --> 00:16:36.590
Let there be a fire beast!

00:17:04.490 --> 00:17:07.130
Devil Arrow!

00:17:10.720 --> 00:17:12.030
Damn!

00:17:12.030 --> 00:17:15.360
You call yourself God?
Then fight like one, Demon God!

00:17:15.360 --> 00:17:16.600
What babble, Devilman!

00:17:19.700 --> 00:17:20.830
God Cutter!

00:17:20.830 --> 00:17:23.040
Devil Cutter!

00:17:25.070 --> 00:17:26.610
God Arrow!

00:17:27.140 --> 00:17:29.590
Devil Arrow!

00:17:39.720 --> 00:17:41.550
God Beam!

00:17:41.560 --> 00:17:44.040
Devil Beam!

00:18:02.610 --> 00:18:04.540
Akira, don't give up.

00:18:04.550 --> 00:18:06.020
Don't give up, Akira!

00:18:06.480 --> 00:18:08.820
Akira! Akira!

00:18:09.920 --> 00:18:11.400
Miki...

00:18:15.920 --> 00:18:20.270
Devil Beam!

00:18:45.050 --> 00:18:47.720
I'm glad you're back
to your old self, Akira.

00:18:47.720 --> 00:18:50.530
I don't know what I would've done
if you were still a monster.

00:18:50.890 --> 00:18:53.530
If I were, would you hate me?

00:18:54.090 --> 00:18:55.540
Not at all.

00:18:57.600 --> 00:18:59.010
You looked very handsome!

00:19:00.500 --> 00:19:01.970
Thank you.

00:19:01.970 --> 00:19:03.240
What for?

00:19:04.170 --> 00:19:08.440
For believing in me, even after I
changed into Devilman before you.

00:19:08.440 --> 00:19:11.940
Whatever you look like on the outside,
deep down you're still Akira!

00:19:11.950 --> 00:19:13.980
That's right!

00:19:13.980 --> 00:19:15.210
I love you, Miki.

00:19:15.220 --> 00:19:16.720
Huh, what was that?

00:19:16.720 --> 00:19:18.630
Nothing at all!

00:19:22.090 --> 00:19:23.570
Oh, Akira...

00:19:26.860 --> 00:19:33.280
No one knows; no one may know

00:19:33.670 --> 00:19:36.100
Devilman has won.

00:19:36.100 --> 00:19:42.580
But, Xenon still has many sinister
demons serving under him.

00:19:42.580 --> 00:19:45.340
Devilman's lonely battle continues.

00:19:45.350 --> 00:19:48.110
When will he realize true victory?

00:19:52.990 --> 00:19:55.630
In the world of man, there is love

00:19:56.290 --> 00:19:59.230
In the world of man, there are dreams

00:19:59.230 --> 00:20:04.230
Wanting only to protect
these beautiful things,

00:20:06.130 --> 00:20:15.640
Devilman is off, somewhere, today

00:20:44.910 --> 00:20:49.910
No one knows; no one may know

00:20:51.650 --> 00:20:56.650
Who Devilman really is

00:20:57.450 --> 00:21:04.300
No one speaks; no one may say

00:21:04.690 --> 00:21:10.110
Who Devilman really is

00:21:10.960 --> 00:21:14.070
In the world of man, there is love

00:21:14.070 --> 00:21:17.270
In the world of man, there are dreams

00:21:17.270 --> 00:21:22.270
Wanting only to protect
these beautiful things,

00:21:24.410 --> 00:21:33.160
Devilman is off, somewhere, today

00:21:47.270 --> 00:21:53.180
No one knows; no one may know

00:21:54.110 --> 00:21:59.390
Where Devilman comes from

00:21:59.850 --> 00:22:04.850
No one speaks; no one may say

00:22:06.990 --> 00:22:11.990
Where Devilman comes from

00:22:13.430 --> 00:22:16.760
For he can never go home again

00:22:16.760 --> 00:22:19.770
He wanders on a journey

00:22:19.770 --> 00:22:26.450
Now that he understands peace

00:22:26.910 --> 00:22:36.580
He'll be Devilman again,
somewhere, tomorrow
